OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1786970910
OL,3,CMoroccan police arrest nearly 300
OL,4,Cmigrants trying to reach Spain's Ceuta
OL,6,FHundreds of migrants trying to reach
OL,7,Fthe Spanish exclave of Ceuta by land
OL,8,Fand sea were arrested by Moroccan
OL,9,Fsecurity forces on Sunday, Moroccan
OL,10,Fstate media reported.
OL,12,FMedi 1 TV said 294 migrants from sub-
OL,13,FSaharan Africa were arrested on
OL,14,FSaturday while attempting to enter
OL,15,FCeuta.
OL,17,FAuthorities also arrested 61 Moroccans
OL,18,Faccused of facilitating the migration
OL,19,Fattempts, the broadcaster reported.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
