PN,31102
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1786970910
OL,3,CMoroccan police arrest nearly 300
OL,4,Cmigrants trying to reach Spain's Ceuta
OL,6,FThe attempted crossings followed a
OL,7,Fsurge in social media posts calling on
OL,8,Fmigrants to make their way to Ceuta, a
OL,9,FSpanish city on Morocco's northern
OL,10,Fcoast.
OL,12,FIn response, Moroccan and Spanish
OL,13,Fauthorities beefed up security
OL,14,Fpresence and limited movement toward
OL,15,Fthe area.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31103
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1786970910
OL,3,CMoroccan police arrest nearly 300
OL,4,Cmigrants trying to reach Spain's Ceuta
OL,6,FThe latest attempt comes two weeks
OL,7,Fafter tens of thousands of would-be
OL,8,Fmigrants, driven by poverty and
OL,9,Fmisinformation, rushed toward Ceuta in
OL,10,Fone of the deadliest migration crises
OL,11,Fto hit the region.
OL,13,FAt least 90 people died on both sides
OL,14,Fof the border, according to official
OL,15,Fnumbers, while human rights groups
OL,16,Freported higher figures.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
