CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1786970910
OL,3,CMoroccan police arrest nearly 300
OL,4,Cmigrants trying to reach Spain's Ceuta
OL,6,FA senior Moroccan diplomat previously
OL,7,Ftold the Associated Press that more
OL,8,Fthan 20,000 Moroccan security
OL,9,Fpersonnel are deployed along the
OL,10,Fborder with Ceuta each day, at a cost
OL,11,Fof hundreds of millions of dollars.
OL,13,FThousands of migrants from across
OL,14,FAfrica and beyond travel to Morocco
OL,15,Feach year, fleeing conflict, poverty
OL,16,Fand instability and seeking a route
OL,17,Finto Europe.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
