CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1786970910
OL,3,CMoroccan police arrest nearly 300
OL,4,Cmigrants trying to reach Spain's Ceuta
OL,6,FMany attempt to reach Ceuta or
OL,7,FMelilla, another Spanish exclave on
OL,8,FMorocco's northern coast, hoping
OL,9,Feventually to make their way to
OL,10,Fmainland Spain and better economic
OL,11,Fopportunities.
OL,13,FThe wave of migrants that entered
OL,14,FCeuta two weeks ago sparked a
OL,15,Fdiplomatic incident between Spain and
OL,16,Fseveral of its fellow EU nations.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/7
