OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1786970910
OL,3,CMoroccan police arrest nearly 300
OL,4,Cmigrants trying to reach Spain's Ceuta
OL,6,FMost notably, Italy's right-wing
OL,7,Fgovernment reintroduced border checks
OL,8,Ffor people entering their country from
OL,9,FSpain, with Madrid introducing similar
OL,10,Fmeasures in response.
OL,12,FThe anti-migrant rhetoric and
OL,13,Fcriticism of Spain's handling of the
OL,14,Fissue triggered an angry response from
OL,15,FSpanish Prime Minister Pedro Sanchez,
OL,16,Fwho called for more cooperative
OL,17,Fefforts to tackle illegal immigration.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/7
