OL,3,CMoroccan police arrest nearly 300
OL,4,Cmigrants trying to reach Spain's Ceuta
OL,6,FHe also pointed out how the vast
OL,7,Fmajority of the tens of thousands of
OL,8,Fmigrants who entered Ceuta left the
OL,9,Fterritory within hours of arriving.
